    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mæssepreost tihtlige þe regollice libbe andfealdre spræce, mæssige, gif he durre, ⁊ ladige hine on ðam husle silf hine silfne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a simple accusation is brought against a priest who lives according to a rule, he shall say mass, if he dares, and by his own asseveration clear himself by the Holy Communion.</ab>
      </div>
